	<li><b>2. All texts render with different fonts</b> than in the design. Title is SFNS-Regular, should be Poppins, Bold. Description text and button labels are SFNS-Regular, should be Inter, Regular. All the texts have a different rendered font - SFNS-Regular.</li>
	<li><b>3. Most of the texts have different sizes</b>. E.g.:<br/>
Actual: </li>
</ul>


